the target language is: prolog. 
    
the templates are:

*a person* is a regular member of PEG at *a date*. 
*a person* has attended a PEG workshop before *a date*.
*a person* has coauthored a paper presented at a PEG workshop before *a date*.
*a person* has attended a PEG online meeting at *a date*.
*a person* is elected for the PEG advisory board by the PEG membership at *a date*.
*an election* is held for the PEG advisory board at *a date*.
*a first date* is within 6 months of *a second date*.
*a person* is a member of the PEG advisory board at *a date*.
*an election* is held for the PEG advisory board at *a date*.

the knowledge base peg2 includes:

a person is a regular member of PEG at a date if 
    the person has attended a PEG workshop before the date 
    or the person has coauthored a paper presented at a PEG workshop before the date.

A person is a regular member of PEG at a date if 
    the person has attended a PEG online meeting at an other date 
    and the date is within 6 months of the other date.

A person is a member of the PEG advisory board at a date T2 if 
    an election is held for the PEG advisory board at a date T1
    and T1 is before T2
    and the person is elected for the PEG advisory board by the PEG membership at T1 
    and it is not the case that 
        an other election is held for the PEG advisory board at a date T 
        and T is after T1 
        and T is before T2.

A date is within 6 months of an other date if 
    the date is after the other date 
    and a third date is 180 days after the other date
    and the date is before the third date.

scenario one is:
    Senior member has attended a PEG workshop before 2026-03-04.
    New member has attended a PEG online meeting at 2026-03-03.
    one expects answers ["Senior member is a regular member of PEG at 2026-3-4T0:0:0.0","New member is a regular member of PEG at 2026-3-4T0:0:0.0"].
    two expect answers [].

scenario two is: 
    Election 2026 is held for the PEG advisory board at 2026-01-01.
    Wise person is elected for the PEG advisory board by the PEG membership at 2026-01-01.
    two expects answers ["Wise person is a member of the PEG advisory board at 2026-3-4T0:0:0.0"].
    one expect answers [].

query one is:
    which person is a regular member of PEG at 2026-03-04. 

query two is:
    which person is a member of the PEG advisory board at 2026-03-04.